info": {"title": "Les Vikings", "originalTitle": "The Vikings", "year": 1958, "plot": "Au X\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, les Vikings s\u00e8ment la terreur sur les c\u00f4tes d'Angleterre. Ragnar, le chef viking, tue le roi et viole la reine. Cette derni\u00e8re donne naissance \u00e0 Eric qui sera captur\u00e9 par les Vikings et \u00e9lev\u00e9 comme esclave. Devenu adulte, il affronte Einar, le fils de Ragnar, et le d\u00e9figure en lan\u00e7ant contre lui son faucon. Quelques temps plus tard, Morgana, la future reine d'Angleterre, est enlev\u00e9e par Einar qui cherche \u00e0 la s\u00e9duire, mais elle tombe amoureuse d'Eric.", "tagline": "Le plus puissant des hommes... Le plus puissant des spectacles... Le plus puissant des films !", "genre": ["Aventure", "Histoire", "Action"], "director": ["Richard Fleischer"], "cast": [{"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}], "studio": ["Brynaprod S.A.", "Curtleigh Productions", "United Artists"], "country": ["US"], "duration": 6840, "rating": 7.013, "votes": 379, "mpaa": "U", "premiered": "1958-06-11", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpWUwT8lkSZWNFrNvJVRkt4uuLK.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uRi6TrBzjXG3IsPqnUP8cz61NRD.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wpWUwT8lkSZWNFrNvJVRkt4uuLK.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 213, "imdbId": "tt0053125", "position": 2000, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "La Mort aux trousses", "originalTitle": "North by Northwest", "year": 1959, "plot": "Patron d\u2019une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 de publicit\u00e9 new-yorkaise, Roger Thornhill a un rendez-vous d'affaires au Plaza Hotel. Mais il y est enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la suite d'un malentendu : ses ravisseurs le prennent pour un certain George Kaplan. Il se retrouve malgr\u00e9 lui dans la peau de ce Kaplan, un espion que tout d\u00e9signe comme tel. Pris entre une myst\u00e9rieuse organisation qui cherche \u00e0 le supprimer et la police qui le poursuit, Tornhill est dans une situation bien inconfortable. Il fuit \u00e0 travers les \u00c9tats-Unis, pourchass\u00e9\u2026", "tagline": "Une course contre la mort.", "genre": ["Thriller", "Aventure"], "director": ["Alfred Hitchcock"], "cast": [{"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}], "studio": ["Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer"], "country": ["US"], "duration": 7800, "rating": 7.962, "votes": 4572, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "1959-08-06", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bBZSbSxvcYM", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxwVitOtjxw2M2lz9SRmAgJNQMz.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/OR8oloCZ3klJtB7Y0i8pSqWw5a.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fxwVitOtjxw2M2lz9SRmAgJNQMz.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 6844, "imdbId": "tt0049833", "position": 3000, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Les Dix Commandements", "originalTitle": "The Ten Commandments", "year": 1956, "plot": "\u00c9vocation de la vie de Mo\u00efse sauv\u00e9 \u00e0 sa naissance par la propre fille du pharaon qui avait d\u00e9ci