es zones d'ombre de leur vie vont refaire surface et, peu \u00e0 peu, les secrets les plus intol\u00e9rables vont \u00e9clater au grand jour.", "tagline": "Trouver le bonheur peut \u00eatre une trag\u00e9die comique.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 8400, "rating": 7.444, "votes": 967, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "1998-10-11", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYfUcEV88Z3gENrfYTE6i8yBkDr.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3AE92av4pGYx9NKKss7x5zEgEOS.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rYfUcEV88Z3gENrfYTE6i8yBkDr.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 64408, "imdbId": "tt0090932", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:44:06.133Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Dernier \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e0 Tanger", "originalTitle": "Dernier \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e0 Tanger", "year": 1987, "plot": "L'\u00e9t\u00e9 1956 \u00e0 Tanger : Richard Corrigan dans son bureau de d\u00e9tective priv\u00e9 r\u00eave d'Am\u00e9rique. Quand un avocat suisse lui propose une forte somme pour porter une enveloppe \u00e0 quelques m\u00e8tres de l\u00e0 au bar de l'h\u00f4tel Minzah. L\u00e0, Claudia, magnifique Italienne de vingt ans l'attend. Pour Corrigan c'est le d\u00e9but de la fortune, mais aussi le commencement des ennuis. De nombreux crimes suivent le sillage de la pulpeuse Claudia.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 6900, "rating": 4.231, "votes": 13, "mpaa": "U", "premiered": "1987-04-22", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmcvedd5wdPiZvSkbXBDavl6KSV.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xj3wNZ9Tpn5DFNpy2lWnLQA8BuI.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/