", "originalTitle": "Jaws", "year": 1975, "plot": "\u00c0 quelques jours du d\u00e9but de la saison estivale, les habitants de la petite station baln\u00e9aire d'Amity sont mis en \u00e9moi par la d\u00e9couverte sur le littoral du corps atrocement mutil\u00e9 d'une jeune vacanci\u00e8re. Pour Martin Brody, le chef de la police, il ne fait aucun doute que la jeune fille a \u00e9t\u00e9 victime d'un requin. Il d\u00e9cide alors d'interdire l'acc\u00e8s aux plages mais se heurte \u00e0 l'hostilit\u00e9 du maire uniquement int\u00e9ress\u00e9 par l'afflux des touristes. Pendant ce temps, le requin continue \u00e0 semer la terr\u2026", "tagline": "Elle fut la premi\u00e8re\u2026", "genre": ["Horreur", "Thriller", "Aventure"], "director": ["Steven Spielberg"], "cast": [{"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}], "studio": ["The Zanuck/Brown Company", "Universal Pictures"], "country": ["US"], "duration": 7440, "rating": 7.684, "votes": 11750, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "1975-06-20", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BlqvX50DSNo", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuRf6gkX0JUJsu1MeECPubhMRdd.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/i1yf91svRHX45l9BXL8rVFzLoPH.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wuRf6gkX0JUJsu1MeECPubhMRdd.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1481343, "imdbId": "tt36958312", "position": 1750, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "La Bouche du Diable", "originalTitle": "The Devil's Mouth", "year": 2026, "plot": "En Tha\u00eflande, cinq amis expl