{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_watchlist", "params": {"type": "movie", "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "sort": "addedAt:desc", "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_watchlist.result.9e1d99538508"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"movies": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1081003, "imdbId": "tt8814476", "addedAt": "2026-09-15T09:34:01.115Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Supergirl", "originalTitle": "Supergirl", "year": 2026, "plot": "Lorsqu\u2019un ennemi inattendu et impitoyable surgit, Kara Zor-El est forc\u00e9e, malgr\u00e9 elle, de faire \u00e9quipe avec un compagnon improbable. Ensemble, ils se lancent dans une \u00e9pop\u00e9e cosmique o\u00f9 la vengeance et la justice sont en jeu, et o\u00f9 Kara doit affronter ses origines pour trouver sa propre voie en tant qu\u2019h\u00e9ro\u00efne.", "tagline": "V\u00e9rit\u00e9. Justice. Et tout le blabla.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 8400, "rating": 6.709, "votes": 2212, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "2026-06-24", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ORQa-D2D3jw", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/54KIfdTEzOliHDKx0OkzYGqAICx.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1284465, "imdbId": "tt32273171", "addedAt": "2026-08-18T19:12:51.792Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "On l'appelait Robin des Bois", "originalTitle": "The Death of Robin Hood", "year": 2026, "plot": "Hant\u00e9 par son pass\u00e9 apr\u00e8s une vie de crimes et de violence, Robin des Bois est 