{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_list_items", "params": {"list_id": "cmtr68ksn002s04juq4qt3zkv", "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_list_items.result.3378d16509a9"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 3480, "imdbId": "tt0073864", "position": 1000, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Le Vieux Fusil", "originalTitle": "Le Vieux Fusil", "year": 1975, "plot": "En 1944, \u00e0 Montauban, le chirurgien Julien Dandieu m\u00e8ne une vie paisible avec sa femme, Clara, et leur fille Florence. Quand, l'invasion allemande l'inqui\u00e8te, pr\u00e9f\u00e9rant les savoir \u00e9loign\u00e9es des possibles dangers, Julien demande \u00e0 son ami Fran\u00e7ois de conduire Clara et Florence \u00e0 la campagne, o\u00f9 la famille poss\u00e8de un ch\u00e2teau, v\u00e9ritable forteresse m\u00e9di\u00e9vale qui surplombe un village. Une semaine plus tard, ne supportant plus l'absence des siens, Julien rejoint sa famille pour d\u00e9couvrir, avec effroi,\u2026", "tagline": "La vengeance n'a jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi douce\u00a0!", "genre": ["Drame", "Histoire"], "director": ["Robert Enrico"], "cast": [{"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}], "studio": ["Les Productions Artistes Associ\u00e9s"], "country": ["FR", "DE"], "duration": 6120, "rating": 7.5, "votes": 296, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "1975-08-20", "trailer": "https://www.