": "Alors qu'une apocalypse zombie marque le d\u00e9but d'une sombre \u00e9poque, de parfaits inconnus font \u00e9quipe pour trouver la force de survivre et retrouver leurs proches.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "rating": 6.975, "votes": 584, "mpaa": "16", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d27fZpY8jSZDOs1k0JCL0RY0b94.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hRwyiBwWKbol9tg3fLFNFkuATqL.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/d27fZpY8jSZDOs1k0JCL0RY0b94.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 83936, "addedAt": "2026-04-04T15:31:59.195Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Das Boot", "originaltitle": "Das Boot", "year": 2018, "plot": "En 1942 dans la France occup\u00e9e, le sous-marin U-612 arrive dans le port atlantique fran\u00e7ais de La Rochelle apr\u00e8s un voyage difficile. Pendant ce temps, au port de La Rochelle, le monde de Simone Strasser devient incontr\u00f4lable alors qu\u2019elle est plong\u00e9e dans une liaison dangereuse et un amour interdit.", "tagline": "Danger Sans Fronti\u00e8res", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 6.9, "votes": 147, "mpaa": "18", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axPd3bA3e0FdLziz1wtZUpP3YDt.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fO7130S6aBRzZvu5ty9ZUZbrU04.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/axPd3bA3e0FdLziz1wtZUpP3YDt.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 67178, "addedAt": "2026-04-04T15:31:48.000Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Marvel's The Punisher", "originaltitle": "Marvel's The Punisher", "year": 2017, "plot": "Un ancien Marine d\u00e9termin\u00e9 \u00e0 punir les criminels qui ont assassin\u00e9 sa femme et ses enfants se retrouve plong\u00e9 au c\u0153ur d'un complot militaire.", "tagline": "La v\u00e9rit\u00e9 doit \u00eatre prise.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "rating": 8.133, "votes": 2998, "mpaa": "16", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https