{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_watchlist", "params": {"type": "movie", "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "sort": "addedAt:desc", "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_watchlist.result.fb168aa2a792"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"movies": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1081003, "imdbId": "tt8814476", "addedAt": "2026-09-15T09:34:01.115Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Supergirl", "originalTitle": "Supergirl", "year": 2026, "plot": "Lorsqu\u2019un ennemi inattendu et impitoyable surgit, Kara Zor-El est forc\u00e9e, malgr\u00e9 elle, de faire \u00e9quipe avec un compagnon improbable. Ensemble, ils se lancent dans une \u00e9pop\u00e9e cosmique o\u00f9 la vengeance et la justice sont en jeu, et o\u00f9 Kara doit affronter ses origines pour trouver sa propre voie en tant qu\u2019h\u00e9ro\u00efne.", "tagline": "V\u00e9rit\u00e9. Justice. Et tout le blabla.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 8400, "rating": 6.709, "votes": 2212, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "2026-06-24", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ORQa-D2D3jw", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/54KIfdTEzOliHDKx0OkzYGqAICx.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1284465, "imdbId": "tt32273171", "addedAt": "2026-08-18T19:12:51.792Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "On l'appelait Robin des Bois", "originalTitle": "The Death of Robin Hood", "year": 2026, "plot": "Hant\u00e9 par son pass\u00e9 apr\u00e8s une vie de crimes et de violence, Robin des Bois est laiss\u00e9 pour mort \u00e0 l\u2019issue d\u2019un combat qu\u2019il pensait \u00eatre le dernier. Recueilli par une femme myst\u00e9rieuse, il se voit offrir une ultime chance de r\u00e9demption\u2026", "tagline": "La fin du mythe.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7380, "rating": 6.3, "votes": 271, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2026-06-18", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C8ybkg0ZZEM", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MEcMhm889D8zIDINnBKOYNiSg1.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7MEcMhm889D8zIDINnBKOYNiSg1.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 476299, "imdbId": "tt6195094", "addedAt": "2026-08-10T19:24:48.876Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Ghostland", "originalTitle": "Ghostland", "year": 2018, "plot": "Suite au d\u00e9c\u00e8s de sa tante, Pauline et ses deux filles h\u00e9ritent d\u2019une maison. Mais d\u00e8s la premi\u00e8re nuit, des meurtriers p\u00e9n\u00e8trent dans la demeure et Pauline doit se battre pour sauver ses filles. Un drame qui va traumatiser toute la famille mais surtout affecter diff\u00e9remment chacune des jeunes filles dont les personnalit\u00e9s vont diverger davantage \u00e0 la suite de cette nuit cauchemardesque.  Tandis que Beth devient une auteur renomm\u00e9e sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans la litt\u00e9rature horrifique, Vera s\u2019enlise dans u\u2026", "tagline": "Vous croyez vraiment conna\u00eetre la peur ?", "genre": ["..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 5460, "rating": 7.397, "votes": 2716, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2018-03-14", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=