e2g\u00e9 de 17 ans, lutte pour reprendre le cours d'une vie normale, alors que rien ni personne ne saurait arr\u00eater Gwen, sa s\u0153ur de 15 ans. Cependant, celle-ci commence \u00e0 recevoir des appels du sinistre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone noir dans ses r\u00eaves, o\u00f9 elle voit sans cesse trois gar\u00e7ons se faire pourchasser dans un camp de montagne appel\u00e9 Alpine Lake. D\u00e9termin\u00e9e \u00e0 mettre fin \u00e0 ces cauchemars et \u00e0 en percer le myst\u00e8re, Gwen persuade son fr\u00e8re de se rendre sur place.", "tagline": "La mort n'est qu'un mot.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6840, "rating": 6.659, "votes": 1254, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2025-10-15", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3OocNMlIlEI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIdsLxoG5bsxpuYIt6GMUQ3pNB9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6zKjoOOb3OZnZuiHtQZn4Kd69Gq.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dIdsLxoG5bsxpuYIt6GMUQ3pNB9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1003598, "imdbId": "tt21361444", "addedAt": "2026-04-15T13:56:08.377Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Avengers: Secret Wars", "originalTitle": "Avengers: Secret Wars", "year": 2027, "plot": "Adaptation de Secret Wars de Jim Shooter et un prochain film de la phase 6 du Marvel Cinematic Universe qui conclura la saga du multivers.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 0, "rating": 0, "votes": 0, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "2027-12-15", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rytc6Lf4447C0CDncwFa4gxe0vY.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 550, "imdbId": "tt0137523", "addedAt": "2026-03-16T12:56:00.121Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Fight Club", "originalTitle": "Fight Club", "year": 1999, "plot": "Le narrateur, sans identit\u00e9 pr\u00e9cise, vit seul, travaille seul, dort seul, mange seul ses plateaux\u2010repas pour une personne comme beaucoup d\u2019autres personnes seules qui connaissent la mis\u00e8re humaine, morale et sexuelle. C\u2019est pourquoi il va devenir membre du Fight club, un lieu clandestin o\u00f9 il va pouvoir retrouver sa virilit\u00e9, l\u2019\u00e9change et la communication. Ce club est dirig\u00e9 par Tyler Durden, une sorte d\u2019anarchiste entre gourou et philosophe qui pr\u00eache l\u2019amour de son prochain.", "tagline": "La premi\u00e8re r\u00e8gle du Fight Club est : on ne parle pas du Fight Club.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 8340, "rating": 8.437, "votes": 32332, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "1999-10-15", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tZpXdiB_pg0", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1i10ptOivG4hV7erkX3tmKpiqm.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/t1i10ptOivG4hV7erkX3tmKpiqm.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 473, "imdbId": "tt0138704", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:44:06.242Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Pi", "originalTitle": "Pi", "year": 1998, "plot": "Max, brillant math\u00e9maticien, souffrant de migraines intol\u00e9rables, est n\u00e9anmoins sur le point de faire la plus grande d\u00e9couverte de sa vie : d\u00e9coder la formule num\u00e9rique qui se cache derri\u00e8re le mar