{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_ratings", "params": {"type": null, "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_ratings.result.29ba7c7fba87"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"movies": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1101383, "imdbId": "tt27165187", "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-09-15T06:31:17.200Z", "info": {"title": "La Fin d'Oak Street", "originalTitle": "The End of Oak Street", "year": 2026, "plot": "Lorsqu\u2019un myst\u00e9rieux \u00e9v\u00e9nement cosmique arrache Oak Street \u00e0 sa paisible banlieue et la transporte vers un lieu inconnu, la famille Platt, d\u00e9sorient\u00e9e dans ce nouvel environnement hostile, comprend vite qu\u2019il leur faudra rester unis pour survivre.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6000, "rating": 6.3, "votes": 470, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "2026-08-12", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t3fQ2lTNtks", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1flRy4qysdwjhlqw2BZ1Wm1zcpM.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/b9q9VmbXDvJmTziRqkwdEmFdwhr.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1flRy4qysdwjhlqw2BZ1Wm1zcpM.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1137844, "imdbId": "tt28014327", "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-09-11T21:11:47.581Z", "info": {"title": "Mayday", "originalTitle": "Mayday", "year": 2026, "plot": "Un pilote de la Navy envoy\u00e9 en mission secr\u00e8te durant la guerre froide se retrouve pi\u00e9g\u00e9 en territoire ennemi. Son seul espoir de survie est de s'allier \u00e0 un ex-agent du KGB excentrique.", "tagline": "Une amiti\u00e9 avec de gros red flags.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6660, "rating": 7.9, "votes": 557, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "2026-09-03", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHELFF4BBxmEk5JyhV017Xcgvwy.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/g7Ccid5kuD7A8hXWlsQiNfwOxaD.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eHELFF4BBxmEk5JyhV017Xcgvwy.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 13922, "imdbId": "tt0326905", "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-09-11T13:11:17.396Z", "info": {"title": "Le Grand Raid", "originalTitle": "The Great Raid", "year": 2005, "plot": "En janvier 1945, l'arm\u00e9e japonaise, qui occupe les Philippines, retient prisonniers dans le camp de Cabanatuan plus de 500 soldats am\u00e9ricains. Parmi eux, le major Gibson, malgr\u00e9 la malaria qui le ronge, tente de remonter le moral de ses troupes qui meurent de faim. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Margaret, une veuve de guerre, il arrive \u00e0 faire p\u00e9n\u00e9trer en contrebande des m\u00e9dicaments. Pendant ce temps, le sixi\u00e8me bataillon de Rangers sous le commandement du lieutenant-colonel Henry Mucci, se pr\u00e9pare \u00e0 lancer une op\u00e9rat\u2026", "tagline": "L'op\u00e9ration de sauvetage la plus triomphale de l'histoire", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7920, "rating": 6.541, "votes": 393, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2005-08-12", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tQTngYIp-UY", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6jRijgpSPsmNY6gkyN7HPntwdl.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6gFB71pIo0PY3OOrojTQ97Qy8qq.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o6jRijgpSPsmNY6gkyN7HPntwdl.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1151031, "imdbId": "tt32246771", "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-09-11T13:11:17.300Z", "info": {"title": "Substitution : Bring Her Back", "originalTitle": "Bring Her Back", "year": 2025, "plot": "\u00c0 la mort accidentelle de son p\u00e8re, Andy r\u00e9clame la garde de Piper, sa demi-s\u0153ur malvoyante, mais il lui manque trois mois pour atteindre les 18 ans r\u00e9glementaires. En attendant, les services sociaux placent Piper chez Laura, une conseill\u00e8re habitu\u00e9e de ce genre de cas. Mais le protecteur Andy refuse de se s\u00e9parer de sa demi-s\u0153ur et s'impose chez Laura, qui habite une grande maison \u00e0 la campagne. Tr\u00e8s vite, l'adolescent remarque le comportement \u00e9trange et intrusif de leur h\u00f4tesse, qui h\u00e9berge d\u00e9\u2026", "tagline": "", "genre": ["..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 6240, "rating": 7.336, "votes": 1916, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2025-05-19", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cyGyW15M0hI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjBNmvAUbl8RMMYmv1dFfP9I1II.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2IIKts2A9vnUdM9tTC76B8tDmuZ.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AjBNmvAUbl8RMMYmv1dFfP9I1II.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 392142, "imdbId": "tt5091538", "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-08-22T22:19:16.815Z", "info": {"title": "La Folle Histoire de Max et L\u00e9on", "originalTitle": "La Folle Histoire de Max et L\u00e9on", "year": 2016, "plot": "1939. Max et L\u00e9on, 25 ans, deux amis ins\u00e9parables, totalement immatures et incons\u00e9quents, d\u00e9sertent leur bataillon dans le seul but de regagner M\u00e2con, retrouver leur petite vie tranquille et boire du Chablis. Mais plus ils cherchent \u00e0 fuir, plus leur petite histoire se retrouve li\u00e9e \u00e0 la grande... au point d'aider au d\u00e9barquement sur les plages de Normandie !", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 5880, "rating": 6.309, "votes": 841, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "2016-11-01", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rDWeALr9g3o", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47qB83tIFr9CuX6RHsTapk0W3Ls.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lNlWxQFrAnbDzOSrXONxII4gKNp.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/47qB83tIFr9CuX6RHsTapk0W3Ls.jpg"}}], "totalMovies": 2639, "tvShows": [{"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 83981, "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-06-02T22:04:21.415Z", "info": {"title": "La Guerre des mondes", "originaltitle": "The War of the Worlds", "year": 2019, "plot": "Dans l'Angleterre des ann\u00e9es 1900, un couple ne cesse de d\u00e9fier les conventions sociales, jusqu'au jour o\u00f9 une invasion extraterrestre les oblige \u00e0 se battre pour leur vie.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 6.7, "votes": 299, "mpaa": null, "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vaBi9eax4Xt6KToGxW3DKeuvHU.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xLh6Lkj0J5d4new50BxDHEB7wjj.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1vaBi9eax4Xt6KToGxW3DKeuvHU.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 15571, "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-06-02T22:04:14.267Z", "info": {"title": "Holocauste", "originaltitle": "Holocaust", "year": 1978, "plot": "Berlin, Allemagne, 1935. Le jour o\u00f9 Karl Weiss, un peintre juif, et Inga Helms, une chr\u00e9tienne, se marient, tous deux et toute la famille Weiss sont pris dans le maelstr\u00f6m du r\u00e9gime nazi, les temp\u00eates de la Seconde Guerre mondiale et les horreurs de la Solution finale criminelle, l'Holocauste, la Shoah ; tandis qu'Erik Dorf, un avocat ambitieux, entreprend sa descente aux enfers aux mains du sinistre Reinhard Heydrich.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 7.3, "votes": 72, "mpaa": null, "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK1gnzIOwZWuTqp4HGEPmjTMijg.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3q4C0QTGU6NoqcW5SV64a21Nn2o.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gK1gnzIOwZWuTqp4HGEPmjTMijg.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 62560, "rating": 9, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-04-04T16:09:40.695Z", "info": {"title": "Mr. Robot", "originaltitle": "Mr. Robot", "year": 2015, "plot": "Elliot est un jeune programmeur anti-social qui souffre d'un trouble du comportement qui le pousse \u00e0 croire qu'il ne peut rencontrer des gens qu'en les hackant. Il travaille pour une firme sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans la cyber-s\u00e9curit\u00e9 mais un homme connu sous le nom de Mr Robot l'approche un jour pour faire tomber une compagnie surpuissante qui fait partie de celles qu'il doit justement prot\u00e9ger\u2026", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 8.3, "votes": 5242, "mpaa": "12", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv1nRqgebSsREnd7vdC2pSGjpLo.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hZOuVkhAWX9viLJuaIsMh8cM3Jz.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kv1nRqgebSsREnd7vdC2pSGjpLo.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 6024, "rating": 10, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-04-04T16:09:35.971Z", "info": {"title": "Police Squad !", "originaltitle": "Police Squad!", "year": 1982, "plot": "Frank Drebin est un fin limier de la police de Los Angeles... enfin presque ! S'il fait bien partie de la police de Los Angeles, le lieutenant Drebin est plut\u00f4t sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9 dans les gaffes, quiproquos, interrogatoires surr\u00e9alistes et catastrophes en cha\u00eene. C'est \u00e0 se demander comment il r\u00e9ussit \u00e0 r\u00e9soudre les enqu\u00eates....", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 7.9, "votes": 423, "mpaa": "NR", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTysaMSwBxy7FLK7M6ivfm6BVRc.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1u4GWKCitJWWkBWU3FP4cBG6non.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nTysaMSwBxy7FLK7M6ivfm6BVRc.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 365, "rating": 8, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-04-04T16:09:35.898Z", "info": {"title": "Jericho", "originaltitle": "Jericho", "year": 2006, "plot": "Une catastrophe nucl\u00e9aire plonge les habitants d'une petite ville du Kansas dans le chaos. Le pays est-il compl\u00e8tement ravag\u00e9 ? Y a-t-il d'autres survivants ? Les doutes, les peurs et le d\u00e9sespoir commencent \u00e0 gagner le petit groupe de survivants. Mais face \u00e0 cette \u00e9preuve, le pire comme le meilleur peut surgir en chaque \u00eatre humain...", "tagline": "Pour la ville de J\u00e9richo, la fin du monde n\u2019est que le d\u00e9but.", "genre": ["...", "...", "...", "..."], "rating": 7.41, "votes": 525, "mpaa": "16", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a57H9UsS388Av2LSLKO9inNmY7j.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6GIf7uiQ4Y5xPzIRkTct2NIyBqK.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/a57H9UsS388Av2LSLKO9inNmY7j.jpg"}}], "totalTv": 98, "seasons": [{"type": "season", "tvShowTmdbId": 42009, "seasonNumber": 3, "rating": 8, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-04-04T17:25:16.334Z", "info": {"title": "Saison 3", "tvshowtitle": "Black Mirror", "season": 3, "plot": "Dans ces contes technologiques, des amants se rencontrent dans un paradis d\u00e9cal\u00e9, des textos tourmentent un jeune homme, et une application exerce un pouvoir inqui\u00e9tant.", "mediatype": "season"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/artzi6jelXm92U0ElcMfmph4Ol1.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dg3OindVAGZBjlT3xYKqIAdukPL.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/artzi6jelXm92U0ElcMfmph4Ol1.jpg"}}, {"type": "season", "tvShowTmdbId": 1920, "seasonNumber": 1, "rating": 10, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-03-20T10:26:25.861Z", "info": {"title": "Saison 1", "tvshowtitle": "Twin Peaks", "season": 1, "plot": "\u00c0 Twin Peaks dans l'\u00c9tat de Washington en 1989, le corps de Laura Palmer, une jolie lyc\u00e9enne connue et aim\u00e9e de tous, est retrouv\u00e9 emball\u00e9 dans un sac en plastique sur la berge d'une rivi\u00e8re par Pete Martell. Le m\u00e9ticuleux agent sp\u00e9cial du FBI Dale Cooper est d\u00e9sign\u00e9 pour mener l'enqu\u00eate. Il d\u00e9couvre alors que Laura Palmer n'\u00e9tait pas celle que l'on croyait et que de nombreux habitants de la ville ont quelque chose \u00e0 cacher.", "mediatype": "season"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FRRrw8DlFCYk8VVBe8uDXxaSeq.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/j5w04XEuFv85N3RIovXBJIHxjSb.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9FRRrw8DlFCYk8VVBe8uDXxaSeq.jpg"}}, {"type": "season", "tvShowTmdbId": 92830, "seasonNumber": 1, "rating": 7, "review": null, "createdAt": "2026-03-16T12:58:48.164Z", "info": {"title": "Mini-s\u00e9rie", "tvshowtitle": "Obi-Wan Kenobi", "season": 1, "plot": "\u00c0 la suite de la chute de l'ordre Jedi, l'Empereur Sith Palpatine a install\u00e9 son r\u00e9gime de fer sur la galaxie. Obi-Wan Kenobi va devoir veiller discr\u00e8tement sur le jeune Luke Skywalker face \u00e0 la menace que repr\u00e9sente l'Empire mais aussi celle d'autres protagonistes, et en particulier son ancien apprenti, devenu le bras arm\u00e9 de l'Empereur : Dark Vador.", "mediatype": "season"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPkm7vwYCa1McT8jEIFWLj393s4.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/p3Jmm6d1ShUrJEuU3DYD2K19c66.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oPkm7vwYCa1McT8jEIFWLj393s4.jpg"}}, {"type": "season", "tvShowTmdbId": 66732, 