{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_watchlist", "params": {"type": "tv", "page": 1, "page_size": 100, "sort": "addedAt:desc", "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_watchlist.result.3548c115fb80"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"tvShows": [{"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 126308, "addedAt": "2026-06-08T15:53:05.971Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Sh\u014dgun", "originaltitle": "Sh\u014dgun", "year": 2024, "plot": "En l'an 1600 au Japon, le seigneur Yoshii Toranaga lutte pour sa survie alors que ses ennemis du Conseil des r\u00e9gents se liguent contre lui, lorsqu'un myst\u00e9rieux navire europ\u00e9en est retrouv\u00e9 \u00e9chou\u00e9 dans un village de p\u00eacheurs voisin.", "tagline": "Une saga \u00e9pique de guerre, de passion et de pouvoir se d\u00e9roulant dans le Japon f\u00e9odal", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 8.427, "votes": 1885, "mpaa": "18", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O4iVfOMQmdCSxhOg1WnzG1AgYT.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bwSmgmd90hCWwqOKQYTEraeOZhJ.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7O4iVfOMQmdCSxhOg1WnzG1AgYT.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 19614, "addedAt": "2026-03-31T11:32:24.140Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "\u00c7a", "originaltitle": "It", "year": 1990, "plot": "\u00c7a r\u00e9pand la terreur et la mort. \u00c7a n'a pas de nom : on ne nomme pas l'innommable. Trente ans plus t\u00f4t, une bande d'enfants s'\u00e9tait jur\u00e9 de se retrouver si \u00c7a ressurgissait un jour. Et, justement, le moment est venu.", "tagline": "Il est revenu", "genre": ["...", "..."], "rating": 6.934, "votes": 3288, "mpaa": "12", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m65RC0QMvLSpPYqm7p85g3ewGUJ.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t