{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_collection", "params": {"type": null, "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "sort": "addedAt:desc", "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_collection.result.7d35ad07158d"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"movies": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 13922, "imdbId": "tt0326905", "addedAt": "2026-09-11T13:11:17.789Z", "format": "digital", "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Le Grand Raid", "originalTitle": "The Great Raid", "year": 2005, "plot": "En janvier 1945, l'arm\u00e9e japonaise, qui occupe les Philippines, retient prisonniers dans le camp de Cabanatuan plus de 500 soldats am\u00e9ricains. Parmi eux, le major Gibson, malgr\u00e9 la malaria qui le ronge, tente de remonter le moral de ses troupes qui meurent de faim. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Margaret, une veuve de guerre, il arrive \u00e0 faire p\u00e9n\u00e9trer en contrebande des m\u00e9dicaments. Pendant ce temps, le sixi\u00e8me bataillon de Rangers sous le commandement du lieutenant-colonel Henry Mucci, se pr\u00e9pare \u00e0 lancer une op\u00e9rat\u2026", "tagline": "L'op\u00e9ration de sauvetage la plus triomphale de l'histoire", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7920, "rating": 6.541, "votes": 393, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2005-08-12", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tQTngYIp-UY", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6jRijgpSPsmNY6gkyN7HPntwdl.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6gFB71pIo0PY3OOrojTQ97Qy8qq.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o6jRijgpSPsmNY6gkyN7HPntwdl.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1151031, "imdbId": "tt32246771", "addedAt": "2026-09-11T13:11:17.695Z", "format": "digital", "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Substitution : Bring Her Back", "originalTitle": "Bring Her Back", "year": 2025, "plot": "\u00c0 la mort accidentelle de son p\u00e8re, Andy r\u00e9clame la garde de Piper, sa demi-s\u0153ur malvoyante, mais il lui manque trois mois pour atteindre les 18 ans r\u00e9glementaires. En attendant, les services sociaux placent Piper chez Laura, une conseill\u00e8re habitu\u00e9e de ce genre de cas. Mais le protecteur Andy refuse de se s\u00e9parer de sa demi-s\u0153ur et s'impose chez Laura, qui habite une grande maison \u00e0 la campagne. Tr\u00e8s vite, l'adolescent remarque le comportement \u00e9trange et intrusif de leur h\u00f4tesse, qui h\u00e9berge d\u00e9\u2026", "tagline": "", "genre": ["..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 6240, "rating": 7.336, "votes": 1916, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2025-05-19", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cyGyW15M0hI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjBNmvAUbl8RMMYmv1dFfP9I1II.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2IIKts2A9vnUdM9tTC76B8tDmuZ.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AjBNmvAUbl8RMMYmv1dFfP9I1II.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1242898, "imdbId": "tt31227572", "addedAt": "2026-09-11T13:11:16.847Z", "format": "digital", "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Predator : Badlands", "originalTitle": "Predator: Badlands", "year": 2025, "plot": "Jug\u00e9 trop faible et indigne par son p\u00e8re, chef de la tribu des Yautja, Dek est sur le point de se faire ex\u00e9cuter par son fr\u00e8re Kwei. Mais au dernier moment, celui-ci pr\u00e9f\u00e8re se sacrifier pour favoriser sa fuite. D\u00e9cid\u00e9 \u00e0 prouver son courage, le jeune paria se rend sur la plan\u00e8te Genna pour y capturer le Kalisk, un monstre r\u00e9put\u00e9 invincible. Confront\u00e9 \u00e0 une nature hostile et impr\u00e9visible, le guerrier inexp\u00e9riment\u00e9 doit sa survie \u00e0 Thia, une andro\u00efde priv\u00e9e de la partie inf\u00e9rieure de son corps dep\u2026", "tagline": "D\u00e9but de la chasse. Derni\u00e8re chance.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6420, "rating": 7.8, "votes": 3617, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2025-11-05", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R2n_TZgmmPo", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/empQGO0pCVTndCpihyVpNfaLebl.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/82lM4GJ9uuNvNDOEpxFy77uv4Ak.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/empQGO0pCVTndCpihyVpNfaLebl.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 433498, "imdbId": "tt5093026", "addedAt": "2026-08-18T13:33:06.226Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Papillon", "originalTitle": "Papillon", "year": 2017, "plot": "Paris 1930, Henri Charri\u00e8re dit \"Papillon\", est condamn\u00e9 \u00e0 la prison \u00e0 vie pour un meurtre qu'il n'a pas commis. Il est envoy\u00e9 au bagne de Cayenne, en Guyane, o\u00f9 il y fera la connaissance de Louis Dega, un c\u00e9l\u00e8bre faussaire. D\u00e9termin\u00e9 \u00e0 s\u2019\u00e9vader par tous les moyens, Papillon fera \u00e9quipe avec Louis, pour trouver le moyen de s\u2019\u00e9chapper de cet enfer.", "tagline": "La plus grande aventure d'\u00e9vasion jamais racont\u00e9e.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "duration": 7020, "rating": 7.317, "votes": 2177, "mpaa": "U", "premiered": "2017-09-07", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3w8jEvy08wk", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3O2DDTk9423pl05wf0ObJ11nKfy.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lfMtVr5hkFeGy4dMaEf3XUQr76d.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3O2DDTk9423pl05wf0ObJ11nKfy.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1339713, "imdbId": "tt37287335", "addedAt": "2026-07-14T08:13:13.869Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Obsession", "originalTitle": "Obsession", "year": 2026, "plot": "Et si vous pouviez r\u00e9aliser votre r\u00eave le plus fou ? Un jeune introverti met la main sur un objet magique capable d\u2019exaucer n\u2019importe quel souhait. Son crush de toujours tombe alors raide dingue de lui\u2026 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019obsession la plus totale. Faites attention \u00e0 ce que vous souhaitez !", "tagline": "Votre relation est toxique ? La leur est mortelle.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 6480, "rating": 8.199, "votes": 5344, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2026-05-13", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eM4P03Zw9C4", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDCR1frpUvGfIKksuM440VLb7X9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rZfmzpixLKLR3Hg2u0WgC7XLFl8.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mDCR1frpUvGfIKksuM440VLb7X9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 687163, "imdbId": "tt12042730", "addedAt": "2026-06-08T22:02:14.978Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Projet Derni\u00e8re Chance", "originalTitle": "Project Hail Mary", "year": 2026, "plot": "Le professeur de sciences Ryland Grace se r\u00e9veille \u00e0 bord d\u2019un vaisseau spatial, \u00e0 des ann\u00e9es-lumi\u00e8re de la Terre, sans aucun souvenir de qui il est ni de la fa\u00e7on dont il est arriv\u00e9 l\u00e0. \u00c0 mesure que sa m\u00e9moire lui revient, il commence \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir sa mission : r\u00e9soudre l\u2019\u00e9nigme d\u2019une myst\u00e9rieuse substance qui provoque l\u2019extinction du Soleil. Il doit faire appel \u00e0 ses connaissances scientifiques et ses id\u00e9es peu orthodoxes pour sauver toute vie sur Terre mais une amiti\u00e9 inattendue pourrait signif\u2026", "tagline": "Croyez en la derni\u00e8re chance.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 9300, "rating": 8.644, "votes": 7591, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "2026-03-15", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rFY7iTqk3UA", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzyy8ZrsuHfAt4iz4iH3rT0tdoT.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8Tfys3mDZVp4tNoH2ktm06a0Tau.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wzyy8ZrsuHfAt4iz4iH3rT0tdoT.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 607844, "imdbId": "tt14810692", "addedAt": "2026-05-11T18:58:37.513Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Escape from Mogadishu", "originalTitle": "\ubaa8\uac00\ub514\uc288", "year": 2021, "plot": "Au d\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 90, la tension monte \u00e0 Mogadiscio. Lorsque la guerre civile \u00e9clate dans les rues de la capitale somalienne, les ambassades de Cor\u00e9e du Sud et de Cor\u00e9e du Nord, prises entre les feux des forces gouvernementales et des rebelles, doivent trouver un moyen de s\u2019en sortir. Quitte \u00e0 laisser leurs diff\u00e9rends diplomatiques de c\u00f4t\u00e9.", "tagline": "Inspir\u00e9 d'une histoire vraie.", "genre": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7260, "rating": 7.1, "votes": 216, "mpaa": "10", "premiered": "2021-07-28", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hT1fpq0HXTQ", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRRLSIGQTxD1gRnmZSMLnxMLWWM.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xbpSvvbd064qT7NAVWMeL7zsl4J.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kRRLSIGQTxD1gRnmZSMLnxMLWWM.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1198994, "imdbId": "tt8036976", "addedAt": "2026-05-04T13:55:33.636Z", "format": "digital", "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Send Help", "originalTitle": "Send Help", "year": 2026, "plot": "Apr\u00e8s un terrible accident d'avion, deux coll\u00e8gues d'une compagnie se retrouvent seuls survivants, coinc\u00e9s sur une \u00eele d\u00e9serte. L'une est une employ\u00e9e maligne et pleine de ressources, l'autre son patron tyrannique et d\u00e9sagr\u00e9able. Oblig\u00e9s de s'adapter aux conditions extr\u00eames de leur isolement, ils doivent surmonter leurs vieilles rancunes et travailler ensemble pour survivre.", "tagline": "C'est elle la chef maintenant.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6780, "rating": 7.045, "votes": 2099, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2026-01-22", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lJO0y4CwtOw", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMAn4qERdEfxotddEHWfMmkfjRv.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bpp58yHuQmpt6xwggI63mVRw7po.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bMAn4qERdEfxotddEHWfMmkfjRv.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 21208, "imdbId": "tt1148204", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:37:47.503Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Esther", "originalTitle": "Orphan", "year": 2009, "plot": "Apr\u00e8s avoir perdu l'enfant qu'elle attendait, la fragile Kate voit ressurgir les douloureux souvenirs d'un pass\u00e9 qu'elle pr\u00e9f\u00e9rerait oublier. Hant\u00e9e par des cauchemars r\u00e9currents, et d\u00e9cid\u00e9e \u00e0 retrouver une vie de couple \u00e9quilibr\u00e9e, elle fait le choix, avec son compagnon John, d'adopter un enfant. A l'orphelinat voisin, Kate et John se sentent \u00e9trangement attir\u00e9s par une fillette, Esther. Mais Kate ne tarde pas \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir la face cach\u00e9e de la \u00ab\u00a0douce\u00a0\u00bb enfant. Autour d'elle, personne n'a rien r\u2026", "tagline": "Quelque chose ne va pas chez Esther\u2026", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7380, "rating": 6.99, "votes": 5595, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2009-07-24", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=03VCf2JugBI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvY2eNImpHcfF3kAXaVmSf82Ecc.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/z7tBFs4Jw4T1TcT3VROsOoIIaiE.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mvY2eNImpHcfF3kAXaVmSf82Ecc.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 760161, "imdbId": "tt11851548", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:37:47.503Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Esther 2 : Les Origines", "originalTitle": "Orphan: First Kill", "year": 2022, "plot": "Apr\u00e8s s'\u00eatre \u00e9chapp\u00e9e d'un \u00e9tablissement psychiatrique estonien, Leena Klammer se rend en Am\u00e9rique en se faisant passer pour Esther, la fille disparue d'une riche famille. Mais lorsque son masque commence \u00e0 tomber, elle se retrouve face \u00e0 une m\u00e8re qui veut \u00e0 tout prix prot\u00e9ger sa famille de l'\u00ab\u00a0enfant\u00a0\u00bb meurtri\u00e8re.", "tagline": "Elle est de retour", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 5940, "rating": 6.605, "votes": 2274, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2022-07-27", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RucsnXRYEb0", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https