...", "..."], "rating": 8.459, "votes": 26525, "mpaa": "16", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRMfekBOnwyE9G0ffyEJIBOjX2n.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2OMB0ynKlyIenMJWI2Dy9IWT4c.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eRMfekBOnwyE9G0ffyEJIBOjX2n.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 87917, "addedAt": "2026-04-04T15:31:59.195Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "For All Mankind", "originaltitle": "For All Mankind", "year": 2019, "plot": "Imaginez un monde dans lequel la course \u00e0 l'espace n'aurait jamais pris fin. Le programme spatial de la NASA est rest\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la culture am\u00e9ricaine et au plus proche des espoirs et des r\u00eaves de tout un chacun. Les astronautes de la NASA, v\u00e9ritables h\u00e9ros et rock-stars de leur \u00e9poque, doivent g\u00e9rer la pression qui p\u00e8sent sur leurs \u00e9paules, tout en g\u00e9rant la vie de leurs familles.", "tagline": "Le d\u00e9but d\u2019une nouvelle ru\u00e9e vers l\u2019or.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "rating": 7.745, "votes": 1027, "mpaa": "12", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwU65YHkNbXpyNVtxGSpDOScMW1.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9OQ5BIITkJwRJo9JA6AlCfJIGBQ.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fwU65YHkNbXpyNVtxGSpDOScMW1.jpg"}}, {"type": "tv", "tmdbId": 90802, "addedAt": "2026-04-04T15:31:59.195Z", "format": null, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Sandman", "originaltitle": "The Sandman", "year": 2022, "plot": "Apr\u00e8s des ann\u00e9es d'emprisonnement, le Seigneur des R\u00eaves commence son p\u00e9riple \u00e0 travers les mondes pour retrouver ce qu'on lui a vol\u00e9 et r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer son pouvoir.", "tagline": "R\u00eaver le nouveau monde", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "rating": 7.872, "votes": 2544, "mpaa": "18", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJGvK70qYSxrqaBDp8bF40YIg59.j