{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_watchlist", "params": {"type": "movie", "page": 1, "page_size": 20, "sort": "addedAt:desc", "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_watchlist.result.c3becd341672"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": {"movies": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1081003, "imdbId": "tt8814476", "addedAt": "2026-09-15T09:34:01.115Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Supergirl", "originalTitle": "Supergirl", "year": 2026, "plot": "Lorsqu\u2019un ennemi inattendu et impitoyable surgit, Kara Zor-El est forc\u00e9e, malgr\u00e9 elle, de faire \u00e9quipe avec un compagnon improbable. Ensemble, ils se lancent dans une \u00e9pop\u00e9e cosmique o\u00f9 la vengeance et la justice sont en jeu, et o\u00f9 Kara doit affronter ses origines pour trouver sa propre voie en tant qu\u2019h\u00e9ro\u00efne.", "tagline": "V\u00e9rit\u00e9. Justice. Et tout le blabla.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 8400, "rating": 6.709, "votes": 2212, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "2026-06-24", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ORQa-D2D3jw", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/54KIfdTEzOliHDKx0OkzYGqAICx.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/p5Dv2O1QVn08IZi8LCc2659TEo9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1284465, "imdbId": "tt32273171", "addedAt": "2026-08-18T19:12:51.792Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "On l'appelait Robin des Bois", "originalTitle": "The Death of Robin Hood", "year": 2026, "plot": "Hant\u00e9 par son pass\u00e9 apr\u00e8s une vie de crimes et de violence, Robin des Bois est laiss\u00e9 pour mort \u00e0 l\u2019issue d\u2019un combat qu\u2019il pensait \u00eatre le dernier. Recueilli par une femme myst\u00e9rieuse, il se voit offrir une ultime chance de r\u00e9demption\u2026", "tagline": "La fin du mythe.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 7380, "rating": 6.3, "votes": 271, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2026-06-18", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C8ybkg0ZZEM", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MEcMhm889D8zIDINnBKOYNiSg1.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7MEcMhm889D8zIDINnBKOYNiSg1.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 476299, "imdbId": "tt6195094", "addedAt": "2026-08-10T19:24:48.876Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Ghostland", "originalTitle": "Ghostland", "year": 2018, "plot": "Suite au d\u00e9c\u00e8s de sa tante, Pauline et ses deux filles h\u00e9ritent d\u2019une maison. Mais d\u00e8s la premi\u00e8re nuit, des meurtriers p\u00e9n\u00e8trent dans la demeure et Pauline doit se battre pour sauver ses filles. Un drame qui va traumatiser toute la famille mais surtout affecter diff\u00e9remment chacune des jeunes filles dont les personnalit\u00e9s vont diverger davantage \u00e0 la suite de cette nuit cauchemardesque.  Tandis que Beth devient une auteur renomm\u00e9e sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans la litt\u00e9rature horrifique, Vera s\u2019enlise dans u\u2026", "tagline": "Vous croyez vraiment conna\u00eetre la peur ?", "genre": ["..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 5460, "rating": 7.397, "votes": 2716, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2018-03-14", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AlX-IAzlqFs", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48GWpOhl1s5hUciV7pvVMHkJnvv.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oFyptNOx02o8sMcSsax4GSCAemg.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/48GWpOhl1s5hUciV7pvVMHkJnvv.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 726209, "imdbId": "tt12747748", "addedAt": "2026-06-08T15:59:19.332Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Le Monde apr\u00e8s nous", "originalTitle": "Leave the World Behind", "year": 2023, "plot": "Amanda et son mari Clay louent une luxueuse villa pour y passer le week-end avec leurs enfants Archie et Rose. Leurs vacances sont bient\u00f4t interrompues lorsque deux inconnus, G.H. et sa fille Ruth, d\u00e9barquent chez eux la nuit, annon\u00e7ant une myst\u00e9rieuse cyberattaque et cherchant \u00e0 se r\u00e9fugier dans cette maison qu'ils pr\u00e9tendent leur appartenir. Les deux familles affrontent alors une menace qui se rapproche inexorablement, obligeant chacun \u00e0 reconsid\u00e9rer sa place dans un monde qui s'\u00e9croule.", "tagline": "Aucun retour \u00e0 la normale n'est possible.", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 8400, "rating": 6.378, "votes": 3298, "mpaa": "12", "premiered": "2023-11-22", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=glPta0GQkTI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8L9D17fnfBIxtL8IPZuX6gzJTu.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5cRw2QHQz5bp7W2KLdSpZoFoTTw.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/m8L9D17fnfBIxtL8IPZuX6gzJTu.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1197137, "imdbId": "tt29644189", "addedAt": "2026-06-08T15:58:21.299Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Black Phone 2", "originalTitle": "Black Phone 2", "year": 2025, "plot": "Depuis son enl\u00e8vement, Finney, aujourd'hui \u00e2g\u00e9 de 17 ans, lutte pour reprendre le cours d'une vie normale, alors que rien ni personne ne saurait arr\u00eater Gwen, sa s\u0153ur de 15 ans. Cependant, celle-ci commence \u00e0 recevoir des appels du sinistre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone noir dans ses r\u00eaves, o\u00f9 elle voit sans cesse trois gar\u00e7ons se faire pourchasser dans un camp de montagne appel\u00e9 Alpine Lake. D\u00e9termin\u00e9e \u00e0 mettre fin \u00e0 ces cauchemars et \u00e0 en percer le myst\u00e8re, Gwen persuade son fr\u00e8re de se rendre sur place.", "tagline": "La mort n'est qu'un mot.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 6840, "rating": 6.659, "votes": 1254, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "2025-10-15", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3OocNMlIlEI", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIdsLxoG5bsxpuYIt6GMUQ3pNB9.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6zKjoOOb3OZnZuiHtQZn4Kd69Gq.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dIdsLxoG5bsxpuYIt6GMUQ3pNB9.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 1003598, "imdbId": "tt21361444", "addedAt": "2026-04-15T13:56:08.377Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Avengers: Secret Wars", "originalTitle": "Avengers: Secret Wars", "year": 2027, "plot": "Adaptation de Secret Wars de Jim Shooter et un prochain film de la phase 6 du Marvel Cinematic Universe qui conclura la saga du multivers.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["...", "..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 0, "rating": 0, "votes": 0, "mpaa": null, "premiered": "2027-12-15", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rytc6Lf4447C0CDncwFa4gxe0vY.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/f0YBuh4hyiAheXhh4JnJWoKi9g5.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 550, "imdbId": "tt0137523", "addedAt": "2026-03-16T12:56:00.121Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Fight Club", "originalTitle": "Fight Club", "year": 1999, "plot": "Le narrateur, sans identit\u00e9 pr\u00e9cise, vit seul, travaille seul, dort seul, mange seul ses plateaux\u2010repas pour une personne comme beaucoup d\u2019autres personnes seules qui connaissent la mis\u00e8re humaine, morale et sexuelle. C\u2019est pourquoi il va devenir membre du Fight club, un lieu clandestin o\u00f9 il va pouvoir retrouver sa virilit\u00e9, l\u2019\u00e9change et la communication. Ce club est dirig\u00e9 par Tyler Durden, une sorte d\u2019anarchiste entre gourou et philosophe qui pr\u00eache l\u2019amour de son prochain.", "tagline": "La premi\u00e8re r\u00e8gle du Fight Club est : on ne parle pas du Fight Club.", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["...", "..."], "duration": 8340, "rating": 8.437, "votes": 32332, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "1999-10-15", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tZpXdiB_pg0", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1i10ptOivG4hV7erkX3tmKpiqm.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/t1i10ptOivG4hV7erkX3tmKpiqm.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 473, "imdbId": "tt0138704", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:44:06.242Z", "priority": 0, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Pi", "originalTitle": "Pi", "year": 1998, "plot": "Max, brillant math\u00e9maticien, souffrant de migraines intol\u00e9rables, est n\u00e9anmoins sur le point de faire la plus grande d\u00e9couverte de sa vie : d\u00e9coder la formule num\u00e9rique qui se cache derri\u00e8re le march\u00e9 des changes. C'est alors que tout bascule dans un immense chaos. Il est \u00e0 la fois poursuivi par une grande firme de Wall Street qui souhaite dominer le monde de la finance, et par des cabalistes qui tentent de percer les myst\u00e8res enfouis derri\u00e8re les nombres secrets.", "tagline": "Il n'y aura pas d'ordre, que le chaos", "genre": ["...", "...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 5100, "rating": 7.113, "votes": 2507, "mpaa": "TP", "premiered": "1998-07-10", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JY0pyh9j1OA", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RUrMQTRZDHRi4QvgkD5gGvOqhe.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pVmCanXNPYqE74cJoL0U6C9ONf5.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9RUrMQTRZDHRi4QvgkD5gGvOqhe.jpg"}}, {"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 15516, "imdbId": "tt0068833", "addedAt": "2026-03-15T11:44:06.242Z", "priority": 3, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "La Derni\u00e8re Maison sur la gauche", "originalTitle": "The Last House on the Left", "year": 1972, "plot": "Pour f\u00eater son dix-septi\u00e8me anniversaire, Mari, accompagn\u00e9e d'une amie, d\u00e9cide de se procurer de la marijuana. Lorsqu'un jeune marginal, Junior, se propose de leur en procurer, elles acceptent, ne se doutant pas que le dealer fait partie d'une bande de sadiques meurtriers emmen\u00e9s par le terrifiant Krug. Leur calvaire va bient\u00f4t commencer.", "tagline": "Il repose sur 13 hectares de terre au-dessus du centre m\u00eame de l'enfer !...", "genre": ["...", "..."], "director": ["..."], "cast": ["...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "...", "..."], "studio": ["...", "...", "..."], "country": ["..."], "duration": 5040, "rating": 6.03, "votes": 794, "mpaa": "16", "premiered": "1972-08-30", "trailer": "", "mediatype": "movie"}, "art": {"poster": "https: