ect entre gags en acc\u00e9l\u00e9r\u00e9s et tartes \u00e0 la cr\u00e8me. Le comique s'entoure notamment de personnages r\u00e9currents et de jolies filles l\u00e9g\u00e8rement v\u00eatues.", "tagline": "", "genre": ["Com\u00e9die"], "rating": 7.27, "votes": 176, "mpaa": "12", "mediatype": "tvshow"}, "art": {"poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3mGj6YAy7CRWMq06gjsXf3rIJ1.jpg", "fanart": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bp30imMTFKAcxrZMi4hjBwY91A6.jpg", "thumb": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/y3mGj6YAy7CRWMq06gjsXf3rIJ1.jpg"}}, "\u2026+39"], "pagination": {"total": 51, "page": 1, "pageSize": 100, "totalPages": 1, "hasMore": false}}, "result_type": "dict", "result_len": 3}, "timestamp": 1789472834659}
{"sessionId": "4ca13f", "runId": "post-fix", "hypothesisId": "C", "location": "meta.py:log_dejavu_rpc", "message": "script.dejavu rpc return", "data": {"kind": "NotifyAll", "action": "get_list_items", "params": {"list_id": "cmnjy44uy001h04l4kt92z93b", "page": 1, "page_size": 100, "minimal": false, "result_property": "script.dejavu.get_list_items.result.900d13e51a38"}, "result": {"success": true, "data": [{"type": "movie", "tmdbId": 670, "imdbId": "tt0364569", "position": 1000, "notes": null, "info": {"title": "Old Boy", "originalTitle": "\uc62c\ub4dc\ubcf4\uc774", "year": 2003, "plot": "\u00c0 la fin des ann\u00e9es 80, Oh Dae-Soo, p\u00e8re de famille sans histoire, est enlev\u00e9 un jour devant chez lui. S\u00e9questr\u00e9 pendant plusieurs ann\u00e9es dans une cellule priv\u00e9e, son seul lien avec l'ext\u00e9rieur est une t\u00e9l\u00e9vision. Par le biais de cette t\u00e9l\u00e9vision, il apprend le meurtre de sa femme, meurtre dont il est le principal suspect. Au d\u00e9sespoir d'\u00eatre s\u00e9questr\u00e9 sans raison apparente succ\u00e8de alors chez le h\u00e9ros une rage int\u00e9rieure vengeresse qui lui permet de survivre. Il est rel\u00e2ch\u00e9 15 ans plus tard, tou\u2026", "tagline": "S\u00e9questr\u00e9 pendant 15 ans. Par qui ? Pourquoi ?", "genre": ["Thriller", "Myst\u00e8re"], "director": ["Park Chan-Wook"], "cast": [{"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}, {"name": "...", "role": "...", "thumbnail": "..."}], "studio": ["Show East", "Egg Film", "Cineclick Asia"], "country": ["KR"], "duration": 7200, "rating": 8.235, "votes